Snippet for `.github/copilot-instructions.md` in a downstream project, for
VS Code Copilot Chat (agent mode). Requires the graph-rag memory MCP server
registered in the workspace (.vscode/mcp.json or the Copilot MCP settings UI)
— see ../../README.md for setup.

VS Code Copilot also discovers a root AGENTS.md automatically, so if the
project already has one, ../AGENTS.md.example covers the same ground and you
